# Step 7: VERIFY — Quality Gate

## Objective
Run all verification gates before shipping.

## Gates
1. `pytest tests/ -q` — all tests pass
2. `mql5-lint` — 0 critical AP on production code
3. `audit-plan-v5.py --post-phase={{phase}}` — audit passes
4. LOC ceiling — all Python scripts < 200 LOC
5. Forbidden files check — no dropped components re-introduced
6. Permission pipeline — EA passes required layers for target mode
7. 8×8 quality matrix — minimum cells passing

## Report Template
```
PHASE: {{phase}}
TESTS: {{passed}}/{{total}} pass, {{skipped}} skip
AUDIT: {{PASS|FAIL}}
LOC_MAX: {{max_loc}} (ceiling: 200)
AP_CRITICAL: {{count}} (must be 0)
```
